WEBVTT

01:40.640 --> 01:44.259
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.050 --> 01:47.250
[Episode 10]

01:47.870 --> 01:49.990
Our two clans have always been closely connected.

01:50.590 --> 01:52.670
I hope we can join hands this time as well

01:52.910 --> 01:53.830
to stand together through thick and thin.

01:54.110 --> 01:55.110
Rest assured, Sir.

01:55.340 --> 01:56.670
I will certainly report this matter

01:56.670 --> 01:58.830
to the City Lord as soon as possible.

02:00.510 --> 02:01.310
Later,

02:01.780 --> 02:03.630
I will also personally go to Yandu

02:04.230 --> 02:05.430
to meet with the City Lord

02:05.630 --> 02:07.230
and discuss this matter with him.

02:07.590 --> 02:08.630
That'll be great.

02:09.190 --> 02:09.990
Please.

02:16.230 --> 02:17.030
Please.

02:21.740 --> 02:23.500
So it's really someone from the Youhu Clan.

02:24.510 --> 02:26.510
Perfect for consecrating my blade.

02:29.090 --> 02:29.920
Are you alright?

02:30.030 --> 02:31.270
Are you hurt anywhere?

02:31.870 --> 02:32.950
What's going on?

02:33.579 --> 02:34.390
The light fell.

02:35.360 --> 02:36.790
So you're the manager of this ship?

02:37.030 --> 02:37.829
Yes, I am.

02:37.910 --> 02:38.829
Who are you?

02:39.390 --> 02:40.230
This is Xue,

02:40.230 --> 02:41.230
a kitchen maid.

02:42.700 --> 02:43.350
Hey, you—

02:43.350 --> 02:44.140
As the manager,

02:44.140 --> 02:45.510
you should do your job properly.

02:45.700 --> 02:47.490
The mast light is a device for transmitting signals.

02:47.829 --> 02:48.630
It ensures the ship's

02:48.630 --> 02:49.910
safe navigation at night.

02:49.910 --> 02:50.550
It should be kept lit

02:50.550 --> 02:51.790
at all times.

02:51.790 --> 02:53.110
Theoretically, before each trip,

02:53.110 --> 02:54.430
you should check it carefully.

02:54.430 --> 02:55.430
But now?

02:55.510 --> 02:56.390
Look at this.

02:56.390 --> 02:58.070
It looks like it hasn't been maintained for years.

02:58.110 --> 02:58.800
With a ship in this condition,

02:58.800 --> 03:00.180
how dare you carry so many passengers?

03:00.210 --> 03:01.660
Aren't you worried about accidents?

03:04.350 --> 03:05.150
That's right.

03:05.180 --> 03:06.420
She has a point.

03:06.470 --> 03:07.710
You do your job poorly.

03:08.510 --> 03:09.310
Manager Cao,

03:09.310 --> 03:09.940
before we set off,

03:09.940 --> 03:11.150
we checked everything one by one.

03:11.150 --> 03:12.550
We didn't find anything unusual.

03:12.550 --> 03:13.550
Well, if you checked,

03:13.550 --> 03:14.870
how could it fall down?

03:14.950 --> 03:17.180
I truly don't know.

03:17.350 --> 03:18.390
When we were inspecting,

03:18.390 --> 03:19.460
it wasn't just me.

03:19.630 --> 03:21.460
He Liu, Li Lian, and others were all present.

03:22.829 --> 03:23.870
Manager, you can call them all

03:23.870 --> 03:25.270
and question them one by one.

03:33.630 --> 03:34.430
Sir!

03:36.300 --> 03:37.110
Sir,

03:38.079 --> 03:39.590
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

03:39.590 --> 03:41.110
is also on our ship.

03:41.440 --> 03:42.270
Who?

03:42.770 --> 03:44.140
The High Priest.

03:48.750 --> 03:50.710
What exactly is today?

03:51.070 --> 03:52.190
The Great Priest of the Youhu Clan

03:52.190 --> 03:53.270
and Mr. Tanghua

03:53.270 --> 03:54.630
are both on my ship.

03:55.510 --> 03:56.310
Great.

03:58.470 --> 03:59.390
That's not right.

04:00.310 --> 04:02.070
If they're both on the ship,

04:02.840 --> 04:04.390
why aren't they together?

04:15.230 --> 04:16.110
You're back.

04:16.110 --> 04:17.269
Was dinner sumptuous?

04:17.269 --> 04:18.390
Yuanzhong sent you here?

04:19.510 --> 04:21.110
He wants you to get off at the next stop.

04:21.630 --> 04:22.430
Why?

04:23.220 --> 04:25.630
He said he gets annoyed just by seeing you.

04:25.630 --> 04:26.950
He told you to stop following him.

04:28.590 --> 04:29.470
Mr. Tanghua,

04:30.510 --> 04:31.780
these snacks can't be kept overnight.

04:31.830 --> 04:32.909
You've already eaten.

04:32.990 --> 04:34.540
How about I take them away?

04:40.430 --> 04:41.390
You should leave.

04:42.070 --> 04:43.030
His seal has been removed.

04:43.030 --> 04:44.110
He's very strong.

04:44.390 --> 04:45.950
If you really anger him,

04:45.980 --> 04:47.220
he might beat you up.

04:47.750 --> 04:49.030
I'm just looking out for you.

04:49.630 --> 04:50.350
Is he going to break

04:50.350 --> 04:51.909
the seals of the other weapon spirits?

04:51.950 --> 04:53.390
Then go find the War Demon?

04:53.590 --> 04:54.590
I can help him.

04:54.950 --> 04:55.870
When he does things,

04:55.990 --> 04:57.270
he never needs help from others.

04:57.409 --> 04:59.240
He didn't need it before, and it's the same now.

04:59.790 --> 05:01.040
Don't worry about it.

05:01.940 --> 05:03.500
Mr. Tanghua, I'm leaving.

05:12.920 --> 05:13.710
Yuanzhong.

05:16.670 --> 05:17.470
Did you see him?

05:17.790 --> 05:18.790
Did you say everything I told you to say?

05:18.790 --> 05:19.500
I did.

05:19.590 --> 05:20.310
What did he say?

05:20.310 --> 05:21.230
He didn't say anything.

05:21.230 --> 05:22.670
But his face was twisted with anger.

05:26.470 --> 05:27.470
Will he leave?

05:28.150 --> 05:28.950
I don't know.

05:29.190 --> 05:30.270
Probably not.

05:30.430 --> 05:32.020
Then why did you make me tell him?

05:32.930 --> 05:33.790
Did you

05:33.790 --> 05:35.430
just want me to go and annoy him?

05:37.470 --> 05:38.260
Yuanzhong,

05:38.870 --> 05:41.070
I think Tanghua is a good person.

05:41.350 --> 05:42.830
Even if you insist on doing this,

05:42.870 --> 05:44.670
he didn't commit any major offense, right?

05:45.390 --> 05:46.550
Cowardice is a sin.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.680
But he's not a coward anymore.

05:49.030 --> 05:50.310
He risked his life to perform

05:50.310 --> 05:51.150
the possessing technique.

05:51.150 --> 05:51.750
Wasn't that to

05:51.750 --> 05:52.909
save you?

05:53.460 --> 05:54.300
That's even worse.

05:54.710 --> 05:56.140
Ignorance is one of the Five Sins.

05:56.350 --> 05:57.510
He's so stupid.

05:57.710 --> 05:58.560
Doesn't he deserve to die?

05:58.990 --> 06:00.510
You can say he's ignorant,

06:00.590 --> 06:01.950
or you can say he's kind.

06:02.150 --> 06:03.070
Everything has

06:03.070 --> 06:04.230
two sides, positive and negative.

06:04.390 --> 06:05.430
It just depends on what perspective

06:05.430 --> 06:06.430
you use to understand it.

06:06.550 --> 06:08.030
You're the one who told me this.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.590
Are you trying to debate philosophy with me?

06:10.870 --> 06:12.150
I can't argue with you.

06:12.230 --> 06:13.420
Your evil roots run deep.

06:13.510 --> 06:15.180
I'm just expressing my own opinion.

06:15.430 --> 06:16.590
I am your weapon spirit,

06:16.830 --> 06:18.390
closely connected to you,

06:18.390 --> 06:19.350
sharing the same fate.

06:20.750 --> 06:21.990
No matter what you do,

06:21.990 --> 06:23.410
I have to support you.

06:23.830 --> 06:24.950
You sound reluctant.

06:31.670 --> 06:32.550
What is this thing?

06:33.409 --> 06:34.260
Grudge Bird.

06:34.710 --> 06:35.560
Grudge Bird?

06:35.870 --> 06:37.630
Isn't it born from blood and resentment?

06:37.630 --> 06:38.950
Why would it attack you?

06:40.190 --> 06:40.990
Yuanzhong,

06:41.880 --> 06:43.440
you're still having bad luck?

06:44.630 --> 06:45.350
This Ji Tanyin,

06:45.350 --> 06:46.950
what's her background anyway?

06:56.470 --> 06:57.430
Twice.

06:57.940 --> 06:59.850
He killed you twice.

07:00.070 --> 07:02.310
And you just forgave him like that?

07:02.350 --> 07:03.150
Yes,

07:03.590 --> 07:05.040
didn't I already say this?

07:05.160 --> 07:06.750
He was kind to people on the ship,

07:06.750 --> 07:07.670
always willing to help others.

07:07.670 --> 07:09.420
That proves I wasn't wrong about him.

07:09.590 --> 07:10.350
He deserves me to

07:10.350 --> 07:11.510
continue fulfilling my promise.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.750
Moreover,

07:13.750 --> 07:14.790
Yuanzhong suspected me

07:14.790 --> 07:15.910
for a reason.

07:16.710 --> 07:17.870
I'm immortal,

07:18.110 --> 07:20.030
with a constitution similar to the War Demon.

07:20.100 --> 07:21.670
He thought I was his enemy,

07:21.750 --> 07:22.790
so he attacked me.

07:22.790 --> 07:23.750
There's no problem with that.

07:24.590 --> 07:26.590
And as a god,

07:26.590 --> 07:28.070
I should be magnanimous and forgiving.

07:28.070 --> 07:28.990
Don't you agree?

07:28.990 --> 07:29.630
Right.

07:29.800 --> 07:30.590
No, not right.

07:30.790 --> 07:32.590
I just want to ask

07:32.900 --> 07:34.180
if he's still

07:34.180 --> 07:34.980
alive now?

07:35.030 --> 07:36.750
He's still alive and well now.

07:36.750 --> 07:37.670
Why should he die?

07:37.670 --> 07:38.990
He killed a god.

07:39.110 --> 07:40.830
You are a fifth-rank true god

07:40.830 --> 07:42.350
bestowed by heaven.

07:42.550 --> 07:45.030
Killing you is a violation of the heavenly way.

07:45.030 --> 07:46.310
He must face divine punishment.

07:46.310 --> 07:47.490
From now on, in this world,

07:47.490 --> 07:49.470
there will be no place for him to exist in,

07:49.470 --> 07:51.510
until the laws of heaven

07:51.510 --> 07:53.270
completely erase him.

07:58.670 --> 08:00.830
No wonder his luck has been so bad lately.

08:00.870 --> 08:01.550
I was thinking

08:01.550 --> 08:03.030
of making a luck-turning device

08:03.030 --> 08:04.190
to protect him.

08:05.590 --> 08:06.470
But wait,

08:07.230 --> 08:08.790
I've already forgiven him.

08:08.950 --> 08:09.670
Why is the heavenly way

08:09.670 --> 08:11.030
still not letting him go?

08:11.110 --> 08:12.790
Did you tell him face to face

08:12.790 --> 08:13.750
in person

08:13.750 --> 08:14.870
that you forgive him?

08:15.900 --> 08:16.630
No.

08:16.630 --> 08:17.880
That's why it's useless!

08:18.030 --> 08:19.740
This kind of forgiveness is not accepted.

08:19.740 --> 08:22.590
You must tell him in person.

08:36.650 --> 08:37.659
[Invitation]

08:37.360 --> 08:39.270
It's my honor for the High Priest

08:39.789 --> 08:41.429
to board this ship.

08:41.830 --> 08:44.110
I have specially prepared a banquet

08:44.110 --> 08:46.180
to welcome you.

08:46.600 --> 08:49.630
I hope you can come.

08:49.790 --> 08:51.230
Did you invite Tanghua as well?

08:52.340 --> 08:54.220
Yes, I did.

08:56.630 --> 08:58.870
If you don't want him,

08:59.620 --> 09:00.540
I can also…

09:00.750 --> 09:01.540
It's fine.

09:02.150 --> 09:03.550
It's just having a meal together.

09:04.190 --> 09:05.100
The more, the merrier.

09:05.830 --> 09:06.520
Let's go.

09:06.790 --> 09:08.230
High Priest, please.

09:43.070 --> 09:43.870
Tanyin!

09:50.030 --> 09:50.880
Oh, you.

09:51.110 --> 09:52.580
Next time you go out, let me know.

09:52.750 --> 09:53.990
Otherwise, if we're both seen together,

09:53.990 --> 09:55.150
that would be terrible.

09:55.230 --> 09:56.110
I got it.

09:59.230 --> 10:00.190
Are you looking for someone?

10:01.990 --> 10:03.230
Do you know Mr. Yuan?

10:03.350 --> 10:04.150
Yes.

10:04.310 --> 10:06.310
But it seems he's gone out.

10:07.430 --> 10:09.510
The master is welcoming him

10:09.510 --> 10:10.670
in the Qinglong Hall tonight.

10:10.750 --> 10:12.000
He should have gone to attend the banquet.

10:18.270 --> 10:19.430
The master specifically ordered guards

10:19.430 --> 10:20.310
to stand guard outside the door.

10:20.310 --> 10:21.870
He probably doesn't want to be disturbed.

10:22.270 --> 10:23.070
Tanyin,

10:23.320 --> 10:24.790
what do you want to go in for?

10:25.670 --> 10:27.260
I just need to go in and say one thing.

10:28.030 --> 10:30.150
Can't it wait until the banquet is over

10:30.150 --> 10:31.030
to say it then?

10:34.740 --> 10:35.550
Come with me.

10:38.150 --> 10:39.110
Who could the master

10:39.110 --> 10:40.230
be entertaining?

10:40.310 --> 10:41.430
Even the Jiaoli wine gifted by the City Lord

10:41.430 --> 10:42.430
has been brought out.

10:42.550 --> 10:43.590
They're even performing the Yunmen dance.

10:43.590 --> 10:44.190
Do you know who it is?

10:44.190 --> 10:46.640
Isn't that a dance of worship?

10:47.110 --> 10:48.150
Why are you here?

10:49.030 --> 10:49.910
I came to see

10:49.910 --> 10:51.550
if there's anything I can help with.

10:51.900 --> 10:53.310
Why are you everywhere?

10:53.430 --> 10:54.240
Alright,

10:54.350 --> 10:55.300
we might be short-handed when serving

10:55.300 --> 10:56.350
the dishes and wine later.

10:56.440 --> 10:57.630
Come over and wait here first.

11:05.240 --> 11:06.430
Such a strong aura of death.

11:11.920 --> 11:14.420
[Qinglong Hall]

11:12.780 --> 11:14.190
We humans have a saying,

11:14.220 --> 11:16.060
"Isn't it a joy to have friends

11:16.220 --> 11:17.270
come from afar?"

11:17.940 --> 11:19.780
The High Priest and Mr. Tanghua

11:19.800 --> 11:22.000
are the most honored guests of the human race.

11:22.220 --> 11:24.810
To have both of you aboard today

11:24.980 --> 11:26.940
is truly a blessing of three lifetimes.

11:27.390 --> 11:29.800
I, Shen, have been extremely anxious these past few days,

11:30.150 --> 11:32.150
fearing that my hospitality might be inadequate.

11:32.370 --> 11:33.690
If there's any negligence,

11:34.070 --> 11:37.070
I hope both of you will be forgiving.

11:37.670 --> 11:38.990
You're too kind, Mr. Shen.

11:39.110 --> 11:40.670
This ship of yours is excellently built.

11:40.910 --> 11:42.270
I quite like it.

11:43.110 --> 11:45.510
Since the High Priest likes it,

11:45.510 --> 11:47.600
my life has not been in vain.

11:51.070 --> 11:53.950
Yesterday, when Mr. Tanghua told me

11:54.030 --> 11:55.830
about the War Demon incident,

11:56.130 --> 11:59.390
I was both angry and afraid.

11:59.500 --> 12:00.700
I couldn't sleep all night.

12:01.370 --> 12:02.170
In five more days,

12:02.280 --> 12:04.330
this ship will reach Yandu directly.

12:04.590 --> 12:06.670
At that time, I will certainly

12:06.700 --> 12:08.380
report this matter truthfully to the City Lord.

12:09.530 --> 12:10.410
High Priest,

12:10.440 --> 12:11.720
what is the destination

12:12.270 --> 12:13.300
of your journey?

12:13.660 --> 12:15.110
Is it Yandu?

12:15.550 --> 12:16.350
No.

12:17.680 --> 12:20.680
Then Mr. Tanghua,

12:20.720 --> 12:22.550
you're going to Yandu with me, right?

12:23.110 --> 12:23.910
I'm not going anymore.

12:24.470 --> 12:25.350
Why not?

12:26.710 --> 12:27.990
Someone is forcing me off the ship.

12:28.220 --> 12:29.020
I can't go anymore.

12:35.110 --> 12:36.190
This is the human race's

12:36.210 --> 12:37.660
homemade Jiaoli wine.

12:37.890 --> 12:39.030
It can't be compared

12:39.030 --> 12:40.110
to the fine wines

12:40.110 --> 12:41.470
of the Youhu Clan,

12:41.490 --> 12:43.720
but it has its own unique flavor.

12:43.980 --> 12:44.980
Please, both of you, have a taste.

12:47.090 --> 12:48.230
High Priest, please.

12:51.550 --> 12:52.460
Mr. Tanghua.

13:01.790 --> 13:03.190
The High Priest hasn't left

13:03.190 --> 13:04.310
the mountain in many years.

13:04.520 --> 13:05.960
This time, you've come down to travel.

13:06.210 --> 13:08.340
Where are you going?

13:09.630 --> 13:10.540
Mr. Shen,

13:10.670 --> 13:12.290
are you trying to inquire about my whereabouts?

13:13.110 --> 13:14.150
I wouldn't dare.

13:15.540 --> 13:16.330
Actually,

13:16.780 --> 13:18.250
I don't know where I'm going either.

13:18.750 --> 13:20.150
I got bored staying on the mountain

13:20.870 --> 13:22.070
and there were people I didn't want to see.

13:22.270 --> 13:23.860
So I thought I'd come down and travel around.

13:24.360 --> 13:26.360
But who would have thought that after coming down the mountain,

13:26.550 --> 13:27.560
I still can't avoid them?

13:28.510 --> 13:30.390
What's that phrase again?

13:30.850 --> 13:32.850
Right, "Lingering like a ghost."

13:34.310 --> 13:37.030
But nine out of 10 things in life

13:37.030 --> 13:38.100
are disappointments.

13:38.160 --> 13:39.850
No one can have smooth sailing all the time.

13:40.110 --> 13:42.040
Ups and downs, annoyances and bad luck...

13:42.070 --> 13:43.390
This is the normal state of life.

13:43.580 --> 13:44.730
I've come to terms with it.

13:46.040 --> 13:48.210
You are humorous.

13:48.330 --> 13:50.730
Why don't I call for some music and dancing?

13:51.110 --> 13:51.950
My ship

13:51.980 --> 13:53.860
happens to have a few top-class performers.

13:54.070 --> 13:55.270
Their dancing and singing

13:55.270 --> 13:56.560
are all excellent.

13:57.350 --> 13:58.230
Dancing?

13:58.870 --> 14:00.700
Mr. Tanghua is also very skilled at it.

14:01.230 --> 14:02.500
Why don't we have him do a dance?

14:02.520 --> 14:03.280
Well...

14:03.750 --> 14:04.900
That's not quite appropriate, is it?

14:05.360 --> 14:06.710
What's wrong with that?

14:07.030 --> 14:08.550
Actually, it's not just Mr. Tanghua.

14:08.550 --> 14:09.670
We of the Youhu Clan

14:09.670 --> 14:11.830
are also very skilled at brewing wine by scent,

14:11.830 --> 14:12.910
and entertaining with song and dance.

14:12.910 --> 14:14.180
Although I haven't done it for many years,

14:14.270 --> 14:15.020
I can still occasionally

14:15.020 --> 14:16.180
perform a piece.

14:17.030 --> 14:19.990
High Priest, you are really talented.

14:21.590 --> 14:22.670
Do you have a Go board?

14:22.750 --> 14:23.550
Yes, we do.

14:23.950 --> 14:24.910
Then how about this?

14:25.140 --> 14:27.590
I'll play a game of Go with Mr. Tanghua.

14:27.740 --> 14:28.860
Whoever loses

14:28.880 --> 14:30.010
will perform a dance

14:30.270 --> 14:31.350
to entertain you.

14:31.510 --> 14:32.550
Consider it payment for your wine.

14:34.050 --> 14:34.860
Alright.

14:39.110 --> 14:40.190
There are no set rules.

14:40.790 --> 14:41.900
No need to be modest either.

14:42.110 --> 14:43.590
If you manage to surround me,

14:43.710 --> 14:45.320
it means my skills are lacking.

14:46.010 --> 14:47.860
But if I accidentally slaughter you,

14:49.390 --> 14:50.750
we'll just have to chalk it up to your bad luck.

14:51.430 --> 14:53.150
Don't be like when you were little,

14:53.510 --> 14:55.070
crying when you lost a game

14:55.070 --> 14:56.540
and tattling on me to everyone.

14:57.870 --> 14:58.870
Mr. Tanghua,

14:59.580 --> 15:00.380
do you dare?

15:02.240 --> 15:03.390
Why wouldn't I dare?

15:08.390 --> 15:09.350
It's almost time.

15:09.350 --> 15:10.790
Move quickly. Follow me.

15:11.310 --> 15:12.110
Hurry.

15:26.670 --> 15:27.750
What's inside?

15:28.110 --> 15:29.270
Can I take a look?

15:36.830 --> 15:37.910
You left before I finished speaking.

15:37.910 --> 15:39.070
You're so rude.

15:50.710 --> 15:51.940
Such a sharp weapon.

15:54.790 --> 15:55.590
Oh no.

16:00.150 --> 16:02.230
You're in too deep now.

16:02.950 --> 16:04.310
If you don't make a killing move,

16:04.530 --> 16:05.320
you will be

16:07.070 --> 16:08.310
the one who dies.

16:16.400 --> 16:17.410
What does this mean?

16:18.460 --> 16:20.180
Don't you want to conquer territory?

16:20.420 --> 16:21.340
I'll let you have it.

16:21.780 --> 16:23.070
How sincere of you.

16:24.850 --> 16:26.150
Unfortunately, I don't care for

16:29.950 --> 16:31.390
what you're offering.

16:34.470 --> 16:36.390
I've been yielding repeatedly because I wanted to.

16:37.350 --> 16:38.350
If I didn't want to,

16:39.190 --> 16:40.470
it would be like metal clashing against stone,

16:41.710 --> 16:43.030
jade shattering everywhere.

16:48.830 --> 16:50.230
You've actually won.

16:50.710 --> 16:51.830
Precise calculations,

16:52.050 --> 16:53.320
decisive in attack.

16:54.140 --> 16:54.950
Tanghua,

16:56.120 --> 16:57.430
it's been years since we've faced each other.

16:58.030 --> 16:59.110
Your chess skills have improved.

16:59.740 --> 17:00.940
What's the use of winning?

17:01.750 --> 17:03.190
You still saw right through me,

17:03.830 --> 17:05.150
using me completely.

17:06.990 --> 17:09.060
Occasional gains and losses aren't worth mentioning.

17:09.230 --> 17:09.910
Haven't I also had

17:09.910 --> 17:11.589
times when I lost to you?

17:11.990 --> 17:13.950
But I've never seen you as an opponent.

17:18.170 --> 17:18.960
Good game.

17:19.349 --> 17:20.630
What a great game indeed.

17:21.240 --> 17:22.510
The choices made, the gains and losses

17:22.510 --> 17:23.630
were mysterious

17:23.630 --> 17:24.950
and absolutely brilliant.

17:25.550 --> 17:26.630
I accept my loss.

17:27.190 --> 17:28.950
I've watched you all

17:28.950 --> 17:30.190
perform the dance of worship year after year

17:30.190 --> 17:31.910
but never had the chance to try it myself.

17:32.030 --> 17:32.830
Mr. Shen,

17:32.990 --> 17:34.200
bring me a dance costume.

17:34.470 --> 17:36.630
I'll perform a dance for everyone today

17:36.650 --> 17:37.480
to liven things up.

17:37.990 --> 17:38.950
That's wonderful!

17:39.230 --> 17:39.990
We are truly fortunate

17:39.990 --> 17:41.390
to be able to see

17:41.550 --> 17:44.030
the dance skills of the High Priest.

18:04.970 --> 18:06.050
Who was she?

18:06.430 --> 18:08.030
How did she see through me?

18:09.190 --> 18:10.230
Have you heard?

18:10.330 --> 18:11.970
The Great Priest of the Youhu Clan is inside.

18:12.030 --> 18:13.390
The Great Priest of the Youhu Clan?

18:13.510 --> 18:14.830
Isn't it Mr. Tanghua?

18:15.100 --> 18:16.180
It's the High Priest.

18:16.470 --> 18:18.150
I heard it from the handmaiden inside.

18:18.910 --> 18:20.750
No wonder they want us to perform the Yunmen dance.

18:20.910 --> 18:22.340
The High Priest is a god.

18:22.370 --> 18:24.820
Of course they want to see the dance of worship.

18:24.920 --> 18:25.780
High Priest.

18:28.000 --> 18:28.630
No wonder.

18:28.670 --> 18:29.470
You can go in now.

18:29.910 --> 18:30.870
Let's go, go in.

18:41.390 --> 18:42.990
Stop. You can't go in.

18:43.990 --> 18:44.940
But I have something to do.

18:44.940 --> 18:45.990
It doesn't matter what you have to do.

18:45.990 --> 18:47.430
The master is entertaining important guests.

18:47.430 --> 18:48.390
Don't cause trouble.

19:09.920 --> 19:10.990
Which one is it?

20:23.990 --> 20:24.990
Find her quickly.

20:24.990 --> 20:26.030
Don't let her escape.

20:29.380 --> 20:30.190
What are you doing?

20:31.310 --> 20:32.120
Be careful!

21:12.750 --> 21:13.550
Yuanzhong!

21:15.150 --> 21:16.430
Hurry, get a doctor!

21:16.680 --> 21:17.430
Hurry, get a doctor!

21:17.430 --> 21:18.710
Yes, go!

21:46.420 --> 21:47.220
How could this be?

21:47.830 --> 21:48.950
This weapon is strange.

21:49.350 --> 21:51.030
My magical power has no effect at all.

21:52.150 --> 21:53.300
Quickly, use the Divine Left Hand!

21:53.350 --> 21:54.750
Counter this evil energy!

22:01.510 --> 22:02.870
Hurry, activate the Divine Hand to save yourself!

22:07.530 --> 22:12.280
The Divine Hand seems to have no effect anymore.

22:18.950 --> 22:20.830
Dr. Sun, please hurry!

22:22.030 --> 22:23.030
Come, this way.

22:24.070 --> 22:25.230
Sir, the doctor is here.

22:25.230 --> 22:25.910
Hurry, hurry!

22:25.910 --> 22:26.870
He got food poisoning.

22:26.870 --> 22:27.710
I had a hard time finding...

22:27.710 --> 22:28.520
Save him quickly!

22:28.520 --> 22:29.310
Hurry!

22:31.670 --> 22:32.630
Where's your medicine?

22:33.480 --> 22:34.470
I don't know either.

22:33.720 --> 22:36.080
♫Time never defeats the fleeting world♫

22:34.470 --> 22:36.310
I just checked the medicine box at noon.

22:36.310 --> 22:37.710
How did it end up like this?

22:37.050 --> 22:39.810
♫Stars turn, shining upon the passing traveler♫

22:38.550 --> 22:39.350
Go away.

22:40.670 --> 22:41.460
Yuanzhong.

22:40.870 --> 22:43.840
♫The wind rises, flowers fall and bloom again♫

22:41.590 --> 22:42.750
Yuanzhong, Yuanzhong!

22:43.270 --> 22:44.430
Yuanzhong, wake up quickly!

22:44.120 --> 22:46.860
♫Awaiting what’s lost to be regained♫

22:44.430 --> 22:45.150
I don't blame you anymore.

22:45.150 --> 22:46.180
I forgive you.

22:47.710 --> 22:49.110
The High Priest lost too much blood.

22:48.290 --> 22:50.790
♫These countless virtues and joys♫

22:49.270 --> 22:50.640
He seems to have passed out.

22:51.350 --> 22:53.070
This kind of forgiveness is not accepted.

22:51.580 --> 22:55.320
♫Dusk and dawn, only you make parting hard♫

22:53.070 --> 22:55.870
You must tell him in person.

22:55.440 --> 23:01.510
♫I'm willing to risk my life for this♫

23:02.540 --> 23:05.230
♫Wind chimes beat with my heart♫

23:06.050 --> 23:09.380
♫Harmonizing, can you recognize it?♫

23:06.110 --> 23:07.150
Yuanzhong, don't sleep.

23:07.920 --> 23:08.830
Listen to me.

23:09.870 --> 23:10.750
I forgive you.

23:09.980 --> 23:12.440
♫Fingertips tracing your outline♫

23:10.750 --> 23:11.950
I don't blame you anymore.

23:13.290 --> 23:16.300
♫I wish to see through you♫

23:13.470 --> 23:14.500
Ji Tanyin.

23:17.160 --> 23:20.150
♫Whether near or far♫

23:20.720 --> 23:24.820
♫We can still gaze upon the same galaxy♫

23:21.390 --> 23:25.230
I said, I forgive him!

23:25.560 --> 23:30.930
♫Knowing we've never been apart for a moment♫

23:31.680 --> 23:34.830
♫If our promise♫

23:34.850 --> 23:38.350
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

23:39.020 --> 23:41.990
♫If fate leads us astray♫

23:42.050 --> 23:46.100
♫Life and death become our bond♫

23:46.340 --> 23:49.330
♫Storms heal with time♫

23:49.490 --> 23:53.450
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

23:54.460 --> 23:59.230
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

24:01.690 --> 24:07.470
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

24:19.220 --> 24:20.020
You're awake.

24:24.320 --> 24:25.230
Where's Zi Fei?

24:25.390 --> 24:26.190
Outside.

24:27.510 --> 24:28.310
Zi Fei.

24:29.300 --> 24:29.850
Zi—

24:30.350 --> 24:31.150
Don't move around.

24:31.470 --> 24:33.110
The assassin's weapon is quite strange.

24:33.210 --> 24:34.550
Even with your Divine Left Hand,

24:34.790 --> 24:35.970
you haven't fully recovered.

24:37.350 --> 24:38.150
Yuanzhong.

24:41.240 --> 24:42.070
Where's the assassin?

24:42.510 --> 24:44.130
We couldn't catch him. He jumped off the ship and escaped.

24:44.190 --> 24:45.110
It was a War Demon.

24:45.180 --> 24:46.170
His skills were impressive.

24:47.400 --> 24:48.110
Go.

24:48.390 --> 24:49.780
Bring Ji Tanyin to me.

24:50.190 --> 24:50.990
Ji Tanyin?

24:52.470 --> 24:53.710
She goes by Xue now.

24:54.750 --> 24:55.990
How do you know

24:55.990 --> 24:57.550
the High Priest of Youhu Clan?

24:58.140 --> 24:59.580
And why did you

24:59.620 --> 25:01.290
say those words to him just now?

25:04.350 --> 25:06.180
Our master is asking you a question.

25:07.470 --> 25:09.150
I can't tell you.

25:09.310 --> 25:09.920
This—

25:10.190 --> 25:10.990
How dare you!

25:11.890 --> 25:13.210
Don't scold me.

25:13.590 --> 25:15.310
Cursing me will bring divine punishment.

25:15.670 --> 25:17.130
I'm doing this for both of your sakes.

25:17.750 --> 25:18.370
You—

25:20.390 --> 25:21.190
Mr. Shen,

25:21.300 --> 25:22.790
the High Priest asked me to look for someone.

25:22.830 --> 25:23.820
Her name is Xue.

25:29.110 --> 25:29.830
The War Demon actually has

25:29.830 --> 25:31.060
a weapon that can counter you.

25:31.090 --> 25:32.380
This matter is too important.

25:32.630 --> 25:34.190
I must send a message back to our clan immediately

25:34.190 --> 25:35.150
to urge the War Division to intensify the search

25:35.150 --> 25:36.310
for traces of the War Demon.

25:36.630 --> 25:37.290
Also,

25:37.630 --> 25:39.290
I believe this matter is related to the human race.

25:39.710 --> 25:40.990
I need to go to Yandu City

25:41.010 --> 25:42.330
to meet with the City Lord of Yandu.

25:42.750 --> 25:43.870
You should rest well first.

25:43.870 --> 25:44.710
It's important to recover from your injuries.

25:44.710 --> 25:45.430
Tanghua.

25:47.470 --> 25:49.110
We are no longer friends.

25:50.770 --> 25:51.970
Why not?

25:52.470 --> 25:53.870
Don't you know why?

25:55.630 --> 25:56.750
Because back then,

25:58.430 --> 26:00.510
I concealed the fact that your parents had died.

26:04.310 --> 26:05.750
At that time, the war was at a stalemate.

26:06.910 --> 26:08.070
The War Demon chief had developed

26:08.070 --> 26:09.510
the perfect War Demon body.

26:10.140 --> 26:11.810
He led a large group of elites to attack.

26:12.450 --> 26:13.680
The human race was wavering.

26:14.070 --> 26:15.590
Our clan's rear was vulnerable.

26:16.310 --> 26:17.250
Under attack from both front and rear,

26:17.250 --> 26:19.270
how could I distract you at that time?

26:22.590 --> 26:24.190
The deaths of your parents and sister

26:25.730 --> 26:26.650
were accidents.

26:27.550 --> 26:28.430
I had intended to...

26:29.270 --> 26:30.940
To tell you afterwards.

26:31.870 --> 26:33.030
But you were injured

26:34.290 --> 26:36.020
and I was sent away by Dingxu.

26:36.470 --> 26:38.270
I never imagined they would

26:39.430 --> 26:40.630
seal you.

26:42.550 --> 26:43.350
Yuanzhong,

26:45.390 --> 26:46.710
I deeply regret it.

26:49.190 --> 26:50.820
These years haven't been easy for me either.

26:54.990 --> 26:55.790
Tanghua,

26:57.830 --> 26:59.510
have you ever seen the sky from inside a well?

27:04.480 --> 27:05.830
It's only as big as a palm.

27:07.140 --> 27:10.220
There's no sun, moon, or stars in it.

27:11.870 --> 27:14.160
It's empty and void.

27:15.260 --> 27:16.250
There's nothing there.

27:21.430 --> 27:22.740
I looked at it for 40 years.

27:24.990 --> 27:26.510
My heart has become closed too.

27:27.010 --> 27:28.490
No matter how many reasons you have,

27:29.590 --> 27:30.910
I can't accept them.

27:33.350 --> 27:34.830
I treated you as a brother,

27:35.430 --> 27:36.190
but under the excuse of

27:36.190 --> 27:37.660
doing what's best for me,

27:37.660 --> 27:39.630
you helped them deceive me,

27:40.290 --> 27:42.400
causing me to not see daylight for 40 years,

27:43.020 --> 27:44.290
enduring all kinds of humiliation.

27:44.730 --> 27:46.370
What makes you think

27:47.070 --> 27:48.350
I would understand you?

27:59.430 --> 28:00.790
Spilt water cannot be gathered up.

28:01.870 --> 28:03.790
Why force the impossible?

28:24.840 --> 28:25.760
Next.

28:28.140 --> 28:29.220
No, I'll go first.

28:30.780 --> 28:31.590
Yuan.

28:34.710 --> 28:35.550
Stop crying.

28:36.460 --> 28:37.270
It's embarrassing.

28:39.150 --> 28:39.950
Yuan.

28:40.870 --> 28:41.670
Alright.

28:42.550 --> 28:43.510
If I succeed,

28:43.750 --> 28:45.390
I'll treat you to the best food and drink in the future.

28:47.670 --> 28:49.100
If I die and you're still alive,

28:50.970 --> 28:51.910
remember to take good care of

28:51.910 --> 28:52.990
my parents and sister for me.

28:53.590 --> 28:55.190
No, no.

28:55.830 --> 28:56.550
Don't.

28:56.550 --> 28:57.350
I'll do it myself.

29:37.990 --> 29:39.270
You're too late.

29:39.910 --> 29:41.350
I met someone I dislike.

29:41.560 --> 29:43.000
I remembered something unpleasant.

29:43.780 --> 29:44.790
I'm in a bad mood.

29:49.710 --> 29:50.510
Come here.

29:52.160 --> 29:54.310
W-Why?

29:55.100 --> 29:55.940
Why?

29:57.590 --> 29:58.740
My hair is messy.

29:59.260 --> 30:00.230
Comb my hair for me.

30:18.630 --> 30:20.460
Your name is Xue, right?

30:23.110 --> 30:24.670
I used to have a handmaiden

30:25.070 --> 30:26.070
who was similar to you.

30:26.710 --> 30:28.030
She was skilled in craftsmanship.

30:28.670 --> 30:29.750
Her handiwork was superb.

30:30.700 --> 30:32.670
The things she made were exquisitely crafted.

30:33.630 --> 30:35.470
Even the master craftsmen of the human race

30:35.650 --> 30:36.920
couldn't match her skills.

30:43.390 --> 30:44.630
Unfortunately, she wasn't very bright.

30:45.200 --> 30:46.310
She always liked to say

30:46.310 --> 30:47.790
illogical things.

30:48.550 --> 30:49.350
She also always liked

30:49.350 --> 30:51.470
to find ways to get close to me.

30:52.790 --> 30:54.070
I couldn't drive her away,

30:54.750 --> 30:56.030
nor could I shake her off.

31:01.670 --> 31:02.870
Aren't you curious?

31:04.750 --> 31:06.270
C-Curious about what?

31:06.580 --> 31:08.140
I said you're very similar to her.

31:08.820 --> 31:10.510
Aren't you curious about how you're similar?

31:13.260 --> 31:14.500
Well, you see,

31:14.600 --> 31:15.800
I have one good quality.

31:16.450 --> 31:17.850
I'm not very curious.

31:18.570 --> 31:20.240
I don't really want to know about other people's business.

31:22.390 --> 31:23.950
What a shame, then.

31:24.830 --> 31:27.190
I happen to be in the mood to talk right now,

31:27.560 --> 31:29.270
even if you don't want to know.

31:31.900 --> 31:33.100
You're just like her.

31:34.620 --> 31:35.790
Your background is strange,

31:36.770 --> 31:38.240
and your methods are strange too.

31:39.140 --> 31:40.700
Most importantly,

31:42.750 --> 31:44.630
I can't see through you clearly.

31:45.770 --> 31:46.770
I'm unable to guess

31:48.160 --> 31:49.240
or understand.

32:01.670 --> 32:02.860
Y-Yuanzhong.

32:11.390 --> 32:12.190
Ji Tanyin.

32:13.230 --> 32:15.350
You really are hard to kill.

32:16.670 --> 32:17.790
I don't understand.

32:18.350 --> 32:19.580
As a War Demon,

32:19.750 --> 32:21.150
why do you repeatedly

32:21.150 --> 32:23.070
sabotage your own people's plans?

32:23.350 --> 32:25.830
What are you really after?

32:26.070 --> 32:27.430
I'm not a War Demon.

32:27.830 --> 32:28.590
You think I'd

32:28.590 --> 32:29.910
believe your lies?

32:30.070 --> 32:31.160
I'm telling the truth.

32:31.160 --> 32:33.190
I hate being lied to the most.

32:34.510 --> 32:35.350
I'm not lying.

32:40.420 --> 32:41.210
What are you doing?

32:42.510 --> 32:43.710
I'm going to verify it.

32:55.090 --> 32:56.130
That person failed.

32:56.310 --> 32:57.350
He was forced to jump off the ship.

32:58.110 --> 32:58.980
He's definitely dead.

32:59.880 --> 33:00.880
With all this commotion,

33:01.230 --> 33:03.030
security has been increased throughout the ship.

33:03.540 --> 33:04.830
This is very unfavorable for us.

33:05.840 --> 33:07.230
We can't worry about that now.

33:07.950 --> 33:08.680
Tomorrow, the ship

33:08.680 --> 33:10.310
will dock at Tianfang City.

33:10.550 --> 33:11.990
It has a major port,

33:11.990 --> 33:13.390
with a military garrison stationed there.

33:13.500 --> 33:15.230
It will be even harder for us to make our move.

33:15.250 --> 33:16.020
Tonight

33:16.060 --> 33:17.730
is our last chance.

33:19.350 --> 33:21.270
Have you all memorized the locations

33:21.290 --> 33:22.850
for placing the fire bombs?

33:22.890 --> 33:23.680
Yes.

33:25.670 --> 33:28.310
Most of the Shen family's ship workers are in the lower cabins.

33:28.710 --> 33:30.070
In two more hours,

33:30.070 --> 33:31.790
it will be their mealtime.

33:32.000 --> 33:34.470
As long as we guard this exit

33:34.470 --> 33:36.470
and use fire bombs to blast the cabin doors,

33:36.500 --> 33:38.550
we can suffocate them inside.

33:38.670 --> 33:39.460
Yes.

33:39.990 --> 33:42.110
This is where the officials and nobles reside.

33:42.190 --> 33:43.950
Most of them have guards with them.

33:43.950 --> 33:45.150
Once the signal is given,

33:45.190 --> 33:46.640
attack this area first.

33:47.270 --> 33:48.070
Yes.

33:48.590 --> 33:50.710
Our target is the Spirit-Gathering Cabin.

33:50.910 --> 33:52.670
This is where the ship's power source is located.

33:52.670 --> 33:54.030
It's heavily guarded.

33:54.030 --> 33:55.750
If we destroy this place,

33:55.750 --> 33:57.390
even a god

33:57.390 --> 33:58.630
won't be able to save them.

33:59.030 --> 33:59.820
Understood.

34:04.830 --> 34:06.630
Men, we are not

34:06.630 --> 34:08.150
bandits who kill indiscriminately.

34:08.750 --> 34:11.070
We are fighting for the future of the human race.

34:11.370 --> 34:12.650
Out with the old, in with the new.

34:12.870 --> 34:13.949
Break things down to rebuild them.

34:14.659 --> 34:16.060
Future generations will give us

34:16.150 --> 34:17.670
a fair evaluation.

34:21.790 --> 34:23.030
No regrets, even in death.

34:23.989 --> 34:25.159
No regrets, even in death.

34:25.190 --> 34:26.510
No regrets, even in death.

34:31.270 --> 34:32.960
Come on, let's drink until we're drunk!

34:58.670 --> 34:59.950
I'm not a War Demon.

35:01.510 --> 35:03.190
Then how do you explain this?

35:05.160 --> 35:06.600
There's nothing to explain.

35:07.630 --> 35:08.870
Besides, in this world,

35:08.870 --> 35:09.870
it's not only War Demons

35:09.870 --> 35:11.110
who have this kind of constitution.

35:11.360 --> 35:12.820
You don't know simply because

35:12.820 --> 35:14.110
you're ignorant, that's all.

35:14.130 --> 35:15.560
I'm ignorant?

35:17.200 --> 35:19.120
You're not going to say you're a god, are you?

35:27.150 --> 35:27.950
Anyway,

35:28.990 --> 35:30.070
I'm not a bad person.

35:30.310 --> 35:31.510
I won't harm you either.

35:31.790 --> 35:33.270
I know you don't believe me,

35:33.270 --> 35:34.980
but I still have to stay by your side.

35:35.030 --> 35:36.150
Even if you don't allow it,

35:36.150 --> 35:37.310
I will still follow you.

35:37.710 --> 35:38.510
Ji Tanyin,

35:39.030 --> 35:39.950
are you...

35:46.830 --> 35:48.510
The Spirit-Gathering Cabin has been bombed!

36:03.500 --> 36:04.350
Kill them!

36:51.270 --> 36:52.070
Watch out!

36:53.810 --> 36:55.170
Sir! Sir!

36:55.190 --> 36:56.270
What happened?

36:56.630 --> 36:58.180
A group of bandits bombed the Spirit-Gathering Cabin.

36:58.180 --> 36:58.710
Our ship

36:58.710 --> 37:00.030
is now low on power.

37:00.030 --> 37:00.630
Don't panic, sir.

37:00.630 --> 37:01.910
We still have another Spirit-Gathering Cabin.

37:02.740 --> 37:03.790
Quickly, stop them!

37:03.790 --> 37:04.390
No matter what,

37:04.390 --> 37:05.870
we must protect that Spirit-Gathering Cabin.

37:05.910 --> 37:06.830
Otherwise, if the ship sinks,

37:06.830 --> 37:07.830
we'll all fall to our deaths.

37:07.830 --> 37:08.670
Yes. Hurry!

37:08.670 --> 37:09.710
Let's go, quickly!

37:10.030 --> 37:11.230
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

37:19.550 --> 37:20.870
The smell of blood is so strong.

37:38.960 --> 37:39.750
Grudge Bird!

37:51.630 --> 37:52.440
Go!

37:52.440 --> 37:53.150
Yes!

38:24.640 --> 38:26.720
Don't catch me!

38:33.870 --> 38:35.990
Oh my god, I'm done for!

38:41.830 --> 38:42.400
Tanyin!

38:42.510 --> 38:43.510
Run to the cabin quickly!

38:44.190 --> 38:44.990
Okay!

39:22.030 --> 39:23.230
Yuanzhong, save them!

39:31.310 --> 39:33.190
Get to the cabin! Get to the cabin!

39:33.310 --> 39:34.110
Get to the cabin!

39:34.110 --> 39:34.990
Don't catch me!

39:35.010 --> 39:35.840
Get to the cabin!

39:36.350 --> 39:37.230
Get to the cabin!

39:37.230 --> 39:38.150
Hurry up!

39:59.390 --> 40:00.190
Hurry!

40:00.220 --> 40:00.940
Thank you.

40:07.250 --> 40:09.050
Heaven is truly on my side.

40:39.070 --> 40:40.790
Yuanzhong, quickly stop them!

41:12.070 --> 41:12.870
Help!

41:13.550 --> 41:14.390
Help!

41:15.310 --> 41:16.230
Help!

41:19.590 --> 41:20.400
Save me!

41:23.870 --> 41:24.670
Help!

41:25.990 --> 41:26.790
Help!

41:28.950 --> 41:29.750
Help!

41:29.910 --> 41:30.710
Help!

41:31.270 --> 41:32.070
Help...

41:42.700 --> 41:43.510
Don't come any closer.

41:43.790 --> 41:45.070
I know you're powerful,

41:45.410 --> 41:46.930
but you can't stop me.

41:47.550 --> 41:49.030
If you blow this place up, you'll die too!

41:49.710 --> 41:51.260
I boarded this ship

41:51.830 --> 41:53.830
with no intention of leaving alive.

41:55.950 --> 41:56.670
What are you doing?

41:56.670 --> 41:57.390
Stop right there!

41:58.670 --> 42:00.230
What a magnificent ship!

42:00.830 --> 42:01.950
This is all the work

42:01.950 --> 42:03.270
of our human craftsmen.

42:03.620 --> 42:05.510
If we continue to develop,

42:06.350 --> 42:09.190
our race will eventually surpass the immortal race.

42:09.550 --> 42:10.220
We will no longer have to

42:10.220 --> 42:11.910
live at the mercy of others.

42:12.070 --> 42:13.630
But I truly don't understand

42:14.190 --> 42:16.750
why you insist on cutting off your own lifeline

42:16.750 --> 42:18.630
by switching to spirit stones for power.

42:19.230 --> 42:20.630
Who exactly are you?

42:20.840 --> 42:22.310
Who am I?

42:22.990 --> 42:25.030
Shen Ying, Mr. Shen,

42:25.050 --> 42:26.370
we've met before.

42:26.790 --> 42:28.190
Back then, you were full of vigor

42:28.190 --> 42:30.310
when you took over the family's ship business.

42:30.350 --> 42:31.990
I even drank at your wedding banquet

42:31.990 --> 42:33.430
held at the Dengyun Tower.

42:34.510 --> 42:35.580
You're a master craftsman?

42:36.270 --> 42:39.110
I've once participated in the building

42:39.110 --> 42:40.990
of half the Shen family's ships.

42:40.990 --> 42:41.750
But unfortunately,

42:41.750 --> 42:43.590
you abandoned the craftsmanship

42:43.590 --> 42:45.670
and switched to the immortal race's crystals.

42:46.000 --> 42:48.390
Those ships that once flew through the sky and burrowed underground,

42:48.470 --> 42:50.430
making the entire world look at our human race

42:50.430 --> 42:52.190
with newfound respect,

42:52.190 --> 42:54.310
have all been reduced to ashes.

42:54.920 --> 42:56.070
In the war between gods and demons,

42:56.390 --> 42:57.510
the majority of those

42:57.670 --> 42:59.230
who died were human civilians.

42:59.910 --> 43:02.510
When the War Demons and Youhu Clan went to war,

43:02.820 --> 43:05.150
it was still us who suffered the most casualties.

43:06.550 --> 43:08.510
Just because we are physically weak,

43:09.070 --> 43:10.070
have short lifespans,

43:10.140 --> 43:12.220
and most of us lack talent for cultivation,

43:13.030 --> 43:15.070
we are like wild weeds in the field.

43:15.670 --> 43:17.230
We are the easiest to grow

43:17.360 --> 43:19.230
and the easiest to be destroyed.

43:20.590 --> 43:21.320
But we

43:21.320 --> 43:22.990
are not completely useless.

43:23.350 --> 43:25.280
We have Goddess Wushuang.

43:25.280 --> 43:26.550
We have our craftsmanship.

43:26.550 --> 43:27.390
It was she who gave us

43:27.390 --> 43:28.790
a new path to survival,

43:28.920 --> 43:30.980
allowing us, with our frail bodies,

43:30.980 --> 43:33.190
to harness the power to move mountains and seas.

43:33.910 --> 43:34.950
We can protect ourselves,

43:34.950 --> 43:35.830
we can defend against enemies,

43:35.830 --> 43:37.350
we can live with dignity.

43:37.350 --> 43:38.270
But you all...

43:39.710 --> 43:41.750
You've abandoned this path.

43:43.630 --> 43:44.710
Why?

43:45.310 --> 43:46.820
Why?

43:46.870 --> 43:48.280
We haven't abandoned craftsmanship.

43:48.280 --> 43:49.070
This is just...

43:49.990 --> 43:51.190
A temporary measure.

43:51.190 --> 43:52.220
At this time,

43:52.220 --> 43:53.710
you still want to deceive me?

43:53.710 --> 43:54.440
Don't be rash.

43:54.440 --> 43:55.590
Don't come any closer!

43:56.350 --> 43:58.150
You're cutting off your own path to survival,

43:58.350 --> 44:00.870
handing over the great situation

44:00.870 --> 44:02.190
created by our predecessors.

44:02.190 --> 44:03.360
This is betrayal!
